24. Ne5 Rc7 25. d5 $2 { Desperation. White was probably under time pressure. Generally, attempting to create a passed pawn without controlling the position is just doomed to fail. } ( 25. Re2 { was necessary, though after } R2c3 $5 { White’s defence requires great accuracy. For example the natural } 26. Nf3 $2 ( { Or simply waiting with } 26. Kh1 $2 { is refuted by } Qb4 $1 { ∓ threatening ...Ra3 trapping White’s queen. The best defence is } 26. Ree1 $1 { ⩱. } ) 
 { runs into } Rxf3 $1 27. gxf3 Nh5 { with a decisive attack. } ) 
